title: "unifolm-wla-toolkit: robot data into the UnifoLM-WLA unified representation"
abstract: "Implements Unitree UnifoLM-WLA-1.0's 54-dim action / 60-dim state unified representation and pipeline, with zero-dependency URDF forward kinematics supplying the step missing from the public datasets, and the specification's seven undefined points written up as open questions."
